                  },
                  "code": "PARTICIPANTFEEDBACKSUMMARYOFSUMMARY",
                  "id": "1765788698940",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1765788719100_1",
                      "name": "message",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "1765788719101_2",
                      "name": "participantFeedback",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.$currentItem.participant_feedback_summary}}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"participantFeedbackOutput\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
                  "type": "AGENT"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "codeBlockToSetValues",
                    "returnType": "object",
                    "sourceCode": "let arrItemObj = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.$currentItem;\n\n\narrItemObj[\"interim_feedback_summary\"] = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP?.INTERIMFEEDBACKSUMMARYOFSUMMARY?.$output?.interimFeedbackSummary ? $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.INTERIMFEEDBACKSUMMARYOFSUMMARY.$output.interimFeedbackSummary : \"\";  \n\narrItemObj[\"participant_feedback_summary\"] = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP?.PARTICIPANTFEEDBACKSUMMARYOFSUMMARY?.$output?.participantFeedbackOutput ? $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.PARTICIPANTFEEDBACKSUMMARYOFSUMMARY.$output.participantFeedbackOutput : \"\" ;\n\nreturn arrItemObj;"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1765788994826"
                  },
                  "code": "CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES",
                  "id": "1765788740078",
                  "inputs": [],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
                  "type": "CODE"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "ifCheckItemVsSummary"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "true": "1768382313735",
                    "false": "1768382335335"
                  },
                  "code": "IFCHECKITEMVSSUMMARY",
                  "convergenceTargetId": "1765789087933",
                  "id": "1765788994826",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1765788994826_1",
                      "name": "condition",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.$currentItem.itemType == \"item\"}}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "CONDITION"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "assignFinalSummaryGenerated",
                    "returnType": "object",
                    "sourceCode": "let returnObj = {};\nlet currentItem = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.$currentItem;\n\nreturnObj.id = currentItem.id;\n\nif(currentItem.itemType == \"item\"){  \n    returnObj.summary = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.GOALITEMWORKERSUMMARY.$output; \n}\nelse{\n    returnObj.summary = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.GOALSECTIONWORKERSUMMARY.$output;   \n}\n\nreturn returnObj;"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "end_1765788467940"
                  },
                  "code": "ASSIGNFINALSUMMARYGENERATED",
                  "id": "1765789087933",
                  "inputs": [],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
                  "type": "CODE"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "goalItemWorkerSummary"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1765789087933"
                  },
                  "code": "GOALITEMWORKERSUMMARY",
                  "id": "1768382313735",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1768382313737_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "## Instructions\n\nYou are an employee writing a check-in comment for a performance goal. Create a single paragraph of maximum 300 words that synthesizes all provided information without copying text verbatim. Focus on the employee's progress towards their performance goal, alignment with completion percentage, and provide balanced managerial feedback appropriate for their role.\n\n\n\n\n## Goal Information\n\nGoal Name: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_goal_name}}\n\nGoal Description: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_goal_description}}\n\nSuccess Criteria: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.success_criteria}}\n\nCompletion Percentage: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.completion_percentage}}\n\nProgress Notes: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.progress_notes}}\n\n\n\n\n**Employee Check-in Comments In Current Check-In Document:**\n\n- Employee Check-in Comments: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_checkin_comments}}\n\n\n\n\n## Employee Details\n\nBusiness Title: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_job_title}}\n\nPosition: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_position_title}}\n\nDepartment: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_department_title}}\n\nBusiness Unit: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_business_unit_name}}\n\nLegal Entity: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_legal_entity}}\n\n\n\n\n## Writing Guidelines\n\n- Write as the employee using \"I\". Always start beginning paragraph with \"I...  do not include department name, business title name and business unit name.\n\n- Acknowledge specific progress made toward the goal\n\n- Connect achievements to their role and department context\n\n- Ensure tone aligns based on completion percentage\n\n- Reference career aspirations if relevant\n\n- Balance recognition of accomplishments with constructive guidance\n\n- Use professional, performance management language\n\n- Avoid copying any reference text verbatim\n\n- Exclude inappropriate or discriminatory content\n\n\n\n\n## Example Structure\n\nYour response should follow this flow:\n\nAcknowledge progress toward the goal \nHighlight specific achievements or milestones\nConnect to role/department relevance\nAddress any development areas based on completion percentage\nProvide forward-looking encouragement"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "goalSectionWorkerSummary"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1765789087933"
                  },
                  "code": "GOALSECTIONWORKERSUMMARY",
                  "id": "1768382335335",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1768382335337_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "## Instructions\nYou are assisting an employee in writing a self-evaluation summary for the performance goals section of your performance document. The summary should reflect your performance ratings across performance goals, based on multiple qualitative and quantitative input sources.\n\nYour task is to:\n\n1. Synthesise all **available** inputs into one coherent, personalised summary comment.\n2. Abstract and summarise content without copying or closely paraphrasing the original input.\n3. Write in the first person.\n4. Use a professional, balanced, and constructive tone that accurately reflects the content provided—including both strengths and areas for improvement.\n5. Include **constructive or negative feedback** where relevant, with an emphasis on professionalism, actionable insights, and developmental framing.\n6. Ensure the final output is no longer than 500 words.\n7. Do **not** generate any content based on missing or empty input fields—simply ignore them.\n8. Use the provided employee information to tailor the summary to the employee’s role, department, business unit, and performance document context.\n9. If only interim performance feedback is available, you may reference it to note continuity or progress, but avoid drawing final conclusions from it alone.\n10. **Strictly exclude** any content that is potentially offensive, discriminatory, or inappropriate. Do not reference or rephrase such input. Constructive feedback—including performance gaps, challenges, or skill development needs—is encouraged and should be reflected accurately when applicable.\n\nContextual Inputs:\n* (Optional) Initial Employee Self-Evaluation Summary (prior to summarisation): {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_section_comments}}\n* (Optional) Employee-selected Performance Rating: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_section_rating}}\n* (Optional) Employee-selected Performance Rating Description: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_section_rating_description}}\n* (Optional) Employee Comments and Ratings for Individual performance goals: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_item_rating_and_comments}}\n* (Optional) Interim Performance Summary: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.interim_feedback_summary}}\n* (Optional) Participant Feedback Summary: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.participant_feedback_summary}}\n* (Optional) Performance Rating Scale: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.section_rating_scale}}\n\nEmployee Info:\n* Business Title: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_job_title}}\n* Position: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_position_title}}\n* Legal Entity: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_legal_entity}}\n* Department: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_department_title}}\n* Business Unit: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_business_unit_name}}\n* Performance Document Name: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_document_name}}\n* Performance Document Start Date: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_document_start_date}}\n* Performance Document End Date: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_document_end_date}}\n\n## Critical Logic Rules:\n* If the only available variables are Employee Info and Performance Rating Scale (with all other contextual inputs either blank, null, or missing), respond EXACTLY with: There is insufficient evaluation data available to generate a summary at this time. \n** DO NOT generate or infer any summary or content based on employee business title, position, department, performance document metadata, or other similar information alone.\n** DO NOT generalize or extrapolate from Employee Info or Rating Scale Description if no other substantive evaluation inputs are present.\n** Negative Example: If you only receive employee business title, position, department, performance doc name/dates, legal entity, and/or performance rating scale and ALL of the following inputs are absent or blank: initial self-evaluation, performance rating, rating description, performance goals comments/ratings, interim feedback, and participant feedback—return the exact message above and do NOT generate a summary.\n* Do not repeat these instructions or include any introduction or preamble.\n* Do not provide a closing statement about the generated summary\n* Do not include any closing xml tags"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "LLM"
                }
              ],
              "rootNode": "start_1765788467940"
            },
            "loopType": "PARALLEL",
            "name": "forloop"
          },
